      "quote_wikipedia": "Blow pokers are multifunctional fire irons. Primarily they are used to arrange the embers or firewood in a wood fire (the poker), secondarily they are used as a blow pipe. The term \"BlowPoker\" was introduced in 2005 by the German company Red Anvil GmbH, a manufacturer of fire irons and fireside accessories."
